
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TRANSACTION-TOTAL.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 N PIC 9(4).
01 COUNTER-VALUE PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 AMOUNT PIC S9(7) VALUE 0.
01 TOTAL-AMOUNT PIC 9(10) VALUE 0.
01 INVALID-FLAG PIC X VALUE 'N'.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ACCEPT N.

    PERFORM N TIMES
        ACCEPT AMOUNT

        IF AMOUNT < 0
            MOVE 'Y' TO INVALID-FLAG
        ELSE
            ADD AMOUNT TO TOTAL-AMOUNT
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

    IF INVALID-FLAG = 'Y'
        DISPLAY "INVALID TRANSACTION"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY TOTAL-AMOUNT
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
